# KRN Harness

1. Run `krn status`.
2. Run `krn start "<task>"`.
3. Run `krn context`.
4. Read `.krn/current/task-contract.md`.
5. Read `.krn/current/context-package.md`.
6. Stop without edits if KRN reports STOP.
7. After edits, run `krn verify` or record why it cannot run.
8. Run `krn handoff`.

Do not include raw research or full KRN architecture in downstream active context.
